comments.text:
@abergamasco thank you for your answers. For the `DNPS-TWILIO` call leads, It might make more sense that we go with something closer to your first option:

> *Scrape the DNPS database on a regular basis to build a mapping of dnps call_id =\> ctn_id =\> domain. Store this mapping in the Martindale database*

I suppose there's currently a cron job from DNPS repo that syncs the call leads from DNPS into the MH database. This job can be leveraged on to sync extra data across. I plan on speaking with someone from the DNPS team on how to proceed with this.
